, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "enpe7n4le03ob11re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "<strong>Tom:</strong>  What would you do if you had the chance to build dynamic software applications only by using one programming language?  Well, this is now possible with C sharp. C sharp is an object-oriented programming language that works with the .Net framework from Microsoft. </br><strong>Tina:</strong> How does this language work? Why should we use it?</br> <strong>Tom:</strong> C sharp seeks to combine all the features used in other programming languages such C++ and Visual Basic into a single one.", "image": "enpe7n4le03ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 0}, {"time": "29600", "text": "<strong>Claire:</strong> But, .Net platform can support different languages. How is C sharp different?</br>\n<strong>Tom:</strong> C sharp facilitates the development of highly portable applications through the use of the .Net platform. When developers use this web framework, they should use Extensible Markup Language or Simple Object Access Protocol. This eases developers' work since they don't need to write additional code when they have to add extra information to a program.</br>\n<strong>Tina:</strong> Somehow, C sharp has similarities with JavaScript; doesn't it?</br>\n<strong>Tom:</strong> You're right!  They both work through object-oriented programming; they only allow single inheritance and they are built in Unicode Support. However, JavaScript should run in any operator system while C sharp code may need compilation.", "image": "enpe7n4le03ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 1}, {"time": "81000", "text": "<strong>Claire:</strong> I think this would make things more difficult. Wouldn't it be better if there was a standard version of C Sharp?</br>\n<strong>Tom:</strong> Well, Microsoft is working with ECMA to standardize this programming language. I think there shouldn't be a problem in encouraging other software companies to create other versions. </br>\nSo far, we can say that C sharp is a modern and extremely popular programming language; if you want to learn it, you just should look for some online tutorials\u2026", "image": "enpe7n4le03ob11re2img03.jpg", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n4le03ob11re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}